<div id="biological_specimen_details">
  <h2>SELECT PHYSICAL OBJECT</h2>

  <div class="form-inline">
    <%= i.input_field :find_parent_work,
                      prompt: :translate,
                      autocomplete: 'off',
                      placeholder: 'Enter complete terms in identifier codes or title',
                      data: {
                        autocomplete: 'work',
                        'autocomplete-url' => find_biological_specimen_autocomplete_url()
                      } %>
  </div>

  <div class="text-center button-wrapper mt-1">
    <a class="btn btn-md btn-primary" id="btn-add-biological-specimen" data-behavior="add-relationship">Select physical object</a>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="block mt-2">
  Currently, physical objects can only be created during media submission. In the future, you will be able to create a new physical object without submitting media. In the meantime, if you can't find the correct physical object record using the search tools above, contact the <a href="mailto:morphosource@duke.org">MorphoSource administrators</a> to have a new physical object record created.
</div>

